hors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2017-04-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/servants-2017-04-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/servants-2017-04-19#:~:text=You%20broke%20our%20trust.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Servants\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"servants-2017-04-19-e12","era":null,"summary":"The carving of Razaketh opens its eyes and the mummies whisper Liliana's name, then attack her and Jace.","participants":["liliana-vess","jace-beleren","razaketh"],"location":"embalming-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/servants-2017-04-19","order":551,"story_date":"2017-04-19","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":165,"quote":"The carving of Razaketh . . . opened its eyes.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/servants-2017-04-19#:~:text=The%20carving%20of%20Razaketh,.%20opened%20its%20eyes.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Servants","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2017-04-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/servants-2017-04-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/servants-2017-04-19#:~:text=The%20carving%20of%20Razaketh,.%20opened%20its%20eyes.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Servants\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"servants-2017-04-19-e13","era":null,"summary":"Liliana realizes that an ambient magic raises all the dead on Amonkhet and that the mummies are controlled physically through the cartouches.","participants":["liliana-vess"],"location":"embalming-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/servants-2017-04-19","order":551,"story_date":"2017-04-19","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":176,"quote":"There was something on this world—natural or artificial, it hardly mattered—that raised the dead.","link":"https://magic.wizards.c